# Brill: The Stillgarden (mod-brill-home, tools/town/garden.py), ChromieCraft's realm: Brill Endures granted
# (the project's stage 1, <5:1>: the garden's stages are invisibility kind 5), Edda Graves on Holt's Rise at
# Brill's eastern edge. A Patch of Earth (weeds, rubble, the marker stakes' soil, Pellen Moss's assessment);
# What Takes Root (gravebloom in the cemetery, the spore cap, Brightwater's silt, the beds); The Garden's
# Hunger (Holt's cracked drain, a Bloated Drain Toad, the drain's mouth, Pellen's soil treatment); A Bloom for
# Every Memory (Willa Fen's quest: Renee's, Dillinger's and Mrs. Winters' flowers, Cold Hearth Manor's seeds,
# a moonpetal lily, the memorial bed); The First Harvest (the ripe herbs, Pellen's stall, the plague graves'
# bouquet, the guests, and Edda's question: the flowers to the front, the mark q971307). Each quest moves the
# stage on; then the garden open (<5:6>): Pellen's wares (the Bouquet of Scarlet Begonias only for the
# flowers' choice), the house's furnishings bought from Edda (<5:7>, the mark q971314; the deed granted for the
# house's own, 970121), and the daily, A Garden Is Kept, offered. (Kills and the long counts are filled with
# .quest complete.)
cmd .levelup 11
cmd .modify money 100000
cmd .brilltown grant 971000
cmd .brilltown grant 970121
# Stage 1: Edda on the overgrown rise.
go 0 2347.0 214.5 38.7
wait 2
cmd .brilltown state
has <5:1>
talk 971300
accept 971300 971300
